544 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (This project successfully delivers a complete cloud-native AWS Cost Optimization System that is fully automated, publicly accessible, and deployment-ready. Starting from a blank folder on a local machine, the project progresses through local development, AWS backend configuration, EC2 server deployment, process management, and finally a complete CI/CD pipeline - covering the full DevOps lifecycle from development to production. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
545 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (The deployed system collects billing data every day without manual intervention, stores historical cost reports in Amazon S3, sends email alerts when spending is too high, and presents all of that data through a professional interactive dashboard that anyone can access from any browser. This project demonstrates strong practical skills in AWS, Python, Linux, DevOps tooling, and cloud architecture that are directly relevant to real-world cloud and DevOps engineering roles.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
